v1.0.55 build 74: replace FadeTransition with SlideTransition for smooth wheel entrance

- sheet_picker.dart: FadeTransition caused opacity compositing overhead on
  the 3-column ListWheelScrollView which made the animation laggy again.
  Replaced with SlideTransition (offset translation only, no opacity layer)
  + ClipRect so the wheel slides up smoothly into place once the modal
  settles, without triggering heavy GPU compositing passes.
